<!--
  LEFT earbud — the user's latest SVG, in its UNMIRRORED orientation.

  WHY THE PAIR IS NOW SET UP THIS WAY:
  The right bud drawable was mirrored per the user's request, and the left bud
  previously held a stale drawing from an earlier round, so the two icons did not
  match. This file is the same latest SVG as ic_bud_right.xml but WITHOUT the extra
  mirror, so the two are guaranteed to be the same artwork in the two orientations
  the user wants — and any future edit to one has an obvious counterpart in the
  other.

  COLOUR RULE (the user's own): white = transparent, black = icon colour.
    fill="#000000"                 -> ink
    stroke="#ffffff"               -> converted to an ink STROKE, shape left hollow
    fill="#ffffff" (grille centre) -> a cut-out
    fill="#000000" (micro-ports)   -> omitted, below renderable size

  TRANSFORM: source 400x500 -> 48x48, scale 0.096 by the long side.
      X = x*0.096 + 5.58      Y = y*0.096
  (This is the fit that centres the shape in the viewport; see ic_bud_right.xml for
  the mirror form, which is X = 48 - x*0.096.)

    body     70,160 -> 12.30,15.36    250,160 -> 29.58,15.36   r 90 -> 8.64
             240,225-> 28.62,21.60    150,210 -> 19.98,20.16   150,250 -> 19.98,24.00
             150,380-> 19.98,36.48     70,380 -> 12.30,36.48   r 40 -> 3.84
    glass    centre 85,108 -> 13.74,10.37  (half-length 1.63, angle -38)
    ear tip  200,210 -> 24.78,20.16   rx 6.14  ry 5.18
    nozzle   218,222 -> 26.51,21.31   rx 1.73  ry 2.69
    grille   218,222 -> 26.51,21.31   rx 1.15  ry 1.92

  Same two simplifications as the right bud, for the same reasons: stroke widths
  raised from sub-pixel values to 1.2, and the three micro-ports omitted.
-->
